# Workspace state: a real database of whatever you imported. A user who clones
# this, imports their leads and commits would publish their own personal data,
# which for this tool would be a special kind of failure.
.kalla/
# Recordings are ignored by default for the same reason: a cast made during a
# real session captures whatever was on screen, including imported data.
*.cast
# The shipped walkthrough is the one deliberate exception.
